{"id":"651136","name":"凉拌土豆丝","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/651136/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"Ⅰ00克"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"500毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆洗净去皮备用。","img":"images/651136/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用擦子擦成细丝放凉水里泡一下。","img":"images/651136/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅里加水开后下入土豆丝烫一下。","img":"images/651136/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出倒入拌花生米及皮芽子。","img":"images/651136/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入味极鲜酱油。","img":"images/651136/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"红油。","img":"images/651136/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/651136/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放上熟的黑芝麻和白芝麻。","img":"images/651136/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入枸杞子装饰一下。","img":"images/651136/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"拌匀可以吃了(成品图)。","img":"images/651136/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}